{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 34,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        54.572994232177734,
        526.6981811523438,
        67.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also noted that equity and access could affect the choice and type of test used. The preferences of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.57299041748047,
        526.7093505859375,
        81.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "clients and programmes are, however, affected by several factors, such as the requirement for sophisticated",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        82.57299041748047,
        526.6831665039062,
        95.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "laboratory infrastructure (e.g. for IGRA) and possible additional costs for clients (e.g. for travel) and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        96.57299041748047,
        526.6481323242188,
        109.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "programmes (e.g. for building and testing). The GDG strongly recommended the two tests as equivalent",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        110.57299041748047,
        327.5111083984375,
        123.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "options, with relatively similar advantages and disadvantages.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.24298095703125,
        526.7031860351562,
        143.04296875
      ],
      "text": "The GDG stressed that the global shortage of TST should be addressed urgently and called for more investment",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.24298095703125,
        340.3571472167969,
        157.04296875
      ],
      "text": "into research on novel tests for LTBI with better predictive value.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.9129638671875,
        526.6892700195312,
        176.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "The GDG cautioned that imperfect performance of these tests can lead to false-negative results, particularly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.9129638671875,
        526.6323852539062,
        190.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "for young children and immunocompromised individuals such as people living with HIV. The GDG noted the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        191.9129638671875,
        526.6383666992188,
        204.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "importance of the tests for identifying recent conversion from a negative to a positive result, particularly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.9129638671875,
        526.64111328125,
        218.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "among contacts of people with pulmonary TB, which is good practice for initiating TB preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.9129638671875,
        526.6492919921875,
        232.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "Nevertheless, recent studies among health care workers tested serially for LTBI in the USA showed that",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.9129638671875,
        526.6432495117188,
        246.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "conversions from negative to positive and reversions from positive to negative are more commonly identified",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.9129638671875,
        526.6650390625,
        260.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "with IGRA than with TST  . Thus, sound clinical judgement must be used in interpreting the results of these  (43)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.9129638671875,
        174.5561065673828,
        274.71295166015625
      ],
      "text": "tests when used serially.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.58294677734375,
        526.65234375,
        294.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG recommended that LTBI testing should not be a requirement for initiating TB preventive treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.58294677734375,
        526.6030883789062,
        308.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "for people living with HIV and child household contacts aged < 5 years, particularly in countries with a high TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.58294677734375,
        526.6732177734375,
        322.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "incidence, given that clear benefits outweigh the risks. HIV-negative infant and child household contacts aged",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.58294677734375,
        526.6771240234375,
        336.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "< 5 years and people living with HIV who have a negative LTBI test should be assessed case by case for their",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.58294677734375,
        453.1991271972656,
        350.3829345703125
      ],
      "text": "individual risk of exposure to TB and the added advantage of receiving preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.6007995605469,
        235.1857147216797,
        381.10479736328125
      ],
      "text": "Considerations for implementation",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.4234313964844,
        526.6093139648438,
        397.2234191894531
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that the availability and affordability of the tests could determine which LTBI test is used. Other",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.4234313964844,
        526.6381225585938,
        411.2234191894531
      ],
      "text": "considerations include the structure of the health system, feasibility of implementation and infrastructure",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.4234313964844,
        131.55609130859375,
        425.2234191894531
      ],
      "text": "requirements.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.09344482421875,
        526.6602783203125,
        444.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "The incremental cost-effectiveness of IGRAs and TSTs appears to be influenced mainly by their accuracy.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.09344482421875,
        526.63525390625,
        458.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "Bacille Calmette-Guérin (BCG) vaccination plays a decisive role in reducing the specificity of TST, leading the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.09344482421875,
        526.72216796875,
        472.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "choice towards IGRA-only strategies. The GDG noted, however, that the impact of BCG vaccination on the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.09344482421875,
        526.7144775390625,
        486.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "specificity of TST depends on the strain of vaccine used, the age at which the vaccine is given and the number",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.09344482421875,
        526.6126708984375,
        500.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "of doses administered. When BCG is given at birth, as is the case in most parts of the world, it has a variable,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.09344482421875,
        526.6875,
        514.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "limited impact on TST specificity  . Therefore, the GDG agreed that a history of BCG vaccination has a  (44)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        516.0934448242188,
        526.701171875,
        528.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "limited effect on interpretation of TST results later in life; hence, BCG vaccination should not be a determining",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        530.0934448242188,
        175.0621337890625,
        542.8934326171875
      ],
      "text": "factor in selecting a test.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        549.763427734375,
        526.6902465820312,
        562.5634155273438
      ],
      "text": "IGRAs are more costly and more technically complex to perform than the TST. Operational difficulties should",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        563.763427734375,
        526.6622924804688,
        576.5634155273438
      ],
      "text": "be considered in deciding which test to use. For example, IGRA requires a phlebotomy, which can be difficult,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        577.763427734375,
        526.686279296875,
        590.5634155273438
      ],
      "text": "particularly in very young children, laboratory infrastructure, technical expertise and expensive equipment;",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        591.763427734375,
        526.5963134765625,
        604.5634155273438
      ],
      "text": "however, only a single visit is required to obtain a result (although patients may have to make a second visit to",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        605.763427734375,
        526.6814575195312,
        618.5634155273438
      ],
      "text": "learn the result). TST is less costly and can be performed in the field, but it requires a cold chain, two health",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        619.763427734375,
        381.1761169433594,
        632.5634155273438
      ],
      "text": "care visits and training in intradermal injection, reading and interpretation.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.50899887084961,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.692996978759766,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "22",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}